# Copying a list with its children and pressing Ctrl+V in a just-opened empty block replaces that block with the copied blocks.
file <<END
Home:
	- Laundry
	- Groceries
		- Milk
		- Eggs
END
keys G k k y G o <C-v>
status NAVIGATE
see ▌     - Groceries
quit
saved <<END
Home:
	- Laundry
	- Groceries
		- Milk
		- Eggs
		- Groceries
			- Milk
			- Eggs
END
